{"item_uid": "指考96-physics-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "如圖 3 所示，在截面積為 0.01 m2的 U 形管中，注入密度為 500kg/ m3的油及密度為\n1000kg/m3的水，左端開口有一活塞使之形成閉口端，活塞的質量及與器壁的摩擦力\n均可不計，活塞下方油深 0.1m。試問需從活塞上方向下施以多大的力，才可維持左\n側閉口端的油面與右側開口端的水面等高？\n力", "options": {"A": "0.98N", "B": "2.5N 油 水\n0.1m", "C": "4.9N", "D": "9.8N", "E": "490N 圖 3"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 58.0, "D": 6.0, "E": 11.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 83.0, "D": 1.0, "E": 9.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 34.0, "D": 13.0, "E": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 17.0, "p_value": 58.0, "p_high": 83.0, "p_low": 34.0, "discrimination": 49.0, "p_quintiles": [90.0, 70.0, 56.0, 45.0, 27.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-physics-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "如圖 4 所示，在平行於+y 方向上施加一強度為 E 的均勻電場，另在垂直射出紙面的\n方向上施加一強度為 B 的均勻磁場。起始時，有一質量為 m、帶有正電荷 q 的質點，\n靜止放置在原點處。只受此電磁場的作用下(重力可不計)，則在質點的運動過程中，\n下列敘述何者正確？\ny", "options": {"A": "任何時刻質點的加速度朝向+y 方向", "B": "任何時刻磁場對質點不作功\nB", "C": "任何時刻電場對質點不作功", "D": "任何時刻磁場對質點的作用力為零 E q+ x\nO", "E": "質點在此電磁場中的運動軌跡為圓形 圖 4"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 42.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 9.0, "E": 18.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 82.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 1.0, "E": 9.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 10.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 17.0, "E": 22.0}, "omit_rate": 16.0, "p_value": 42.0, "p_high": 82.0, "p_low": 12.0, "discrimination": 70.0, "p_quintiles": [93.0, 59.0, 29.0, 17.0, 9.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-physics-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "如圖 5 所示，將一揚聲器置於一管狀物的一端開口處，連續改變揚聲器發出的聲頻，\n發現當頻率為 400 Hz、500 Hz、及 600 Hz 時都會產生共鳴。關於此管狀物的敘述，\n下列何者可能為正確？", "options": {"A": "另一端為閉口，基頻為 100Hz", "B": "另一端為閉口，基頻為 200Hz ?", "C": "另一端為開口，基頻為 100Hz\n圖 5", "D": "另一端為開口，基頻為 200Hz", "E": "另一端可以為開口，也可以為閉口\n- 2 -\n第 3 頁 96年指考\n共 7 頁 物理考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 17.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 39.0, "D": 7.0, "E": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 7.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 66.0, "D": 5.0, "E": 8.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 28.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 9.0, "E": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 20.0, "p_value": 38.0, "p_high": 66.0, "p_low": 15.0, "discrimination": 51.0, "p_quintiles": [75.0, 50.0, 34.0, 21.0, 12.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-physics-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "小聰有一支會發綠光的雷射筆，他在實驗室中想用單狹縫繞射來決定此綠光的波\n長，若已知單狹縫的縫寬為 d，他還需要測量下列哪些物理量：筆的長度 (cid:65)、光源\n到屏壁的距離 L 1 、單狹縫到屏壁的距離 L 2 、在屏壁上中央亮紋附近所產生兩暗紋的\n間距 y，才能求得此綠光的波長？", "options": {"A": "(cid:65)，L 1", "B": "(cid:65)，L 2", "C": "L 1 ，L 2", "D": "y，L 1", "E": "y，L 2"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 11.0, "E": 75.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 2.0, "E": 97.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 3.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 23.0, "E": 45.0}, "omit_rate": 6.0, "p_value": 75.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 45.0, "discrimination": 52.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 94.0, 85.0, 65.0, 34.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-physics-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "甲、乙兩鋼瓶分別裝有3莫耳的氦氣及1莫耳的氬氣，兩鋼瓶維持固定溫度，甲鋼瓶\n內氦氣的温度為300 K，乙鋼瓶內氬氣的温度為450 K，且甲鋼瓶容積為乙鋼瓶容積\n的2倍。下列有關兩鋼瓶內理想氣體的敍述中何者正確？(氦的原子量為4，氬的原子\n量為40)", "options": {"A": "氫原子在基態時，電子的角速率為\nma\n0\n(cid:61)2", "B": "氫原子在基態時，電子的靜電位能為－\nma2\n0\n(cid:61)2", "C": "氫原子在基態時，電子的總能量為+\n2ma2\n0\n2(cid:61)2", "D": "氫原子在第一受激態時，電子的總能量為+\nma2\n0", "E": "作等速率圓周運動的電子在質子處產生的磁場為零"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 52.0, "D": 6.0, "E": 10.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 83.0, "D": 1.0, "E": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 21.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 11.0, "E": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 12.0, "p_value": 52.0, "p_high": 83.0, "p_low": 22.0, "discrimination": 61.0, "p_quintiles": [89.0, 70.0, 51.0, 34.0, 17.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
